{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.rabbit",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她在冰箱前拿着油性笔",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.rabbit",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.rabbit",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────啊，にちか。那个放进冰箱的时候，麻烦写上名字。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱歉啊。吃的东西嘛，会跟别人的撞上……要处理的时候也麻烦。喏，笔。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────哇，油性笔啊。那种的，超级土的吧──！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？我觉得挺合理的……はづきさん也提醒过我。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊──姐姐啊──……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "嘛，我写就是了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────咦？不写吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊，请别管我。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……油性笔，会紧张！被看着就更写不出来了──！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，不是……抱歉。不过也不用那么紧张吧，反正都会吃掉────",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──这个，会被看到的哦？被其他人！！？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "要是被觉得『哇好土』，那我就死定了啊！！！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊。就像签名一样的东西啊……！在意别人怎么看，是好事哦……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……────",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………哈哈，还画了图案啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "向日葵吗，画得挺好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "嘛……兔子啊熊啊……还有郁金香什么的，要是被觉得装可爱也很那个──……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………小学入学的时候，各种东西都得写上名字……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "姐姐……帮我写了的，我的那些全部。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────啊，这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那可是油性笔哦……那种东西……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "要用一年……说不定要用六年的东西……是绝对不能写错的啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……はづきさん，从以前就是这种地方不会出错的人啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊──，是的。所以名字是没问题……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──就是，画了个很奇怪的角色，像仓鼠那种！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "好像是觉得我会高兴，可是，据说是我想说兔子更好",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "姐姐把那只仓鼠的耳朵拉长了哦──硬是从上面！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那、那真是……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "然后接缝很怪，耳朵就全涂黑了……那里只有一片黑很奇怪，就全身涂黑了……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "成了超────恐怖的东西……！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────呼、哈哈哈…………",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，抱歉……────呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊哈哈哈哈……！",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……总觉得，是个好故事。向日葵旁边，把那只兔子也画上去不好吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……哇──，别说随便的话──！",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，可是有点想看──",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "手，伸出来。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "小、小一点！",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "谨、谨慎一点！",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "────好、好痒！",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "会不会变小我不知道哦──耳朵要拉长的",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，太显眼的话，我的工作也────",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊哈哈哈哈……！────咕噜咕噜…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──不是……哈哈，好开心啊────",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。画只好兔子吧。难得用油性笔画的！"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "诶？我超级认真地画着呢，从刚才开始",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "说草率话的，不是制作人先生吗──",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────是、是啊。抱歉……我以前从没那样想过写名字这件事。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但是，我明白了。油性笔是擦不掉的。",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "擦不掉的东西，就得小心地写。",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那，我开始了哦",
        "nextNodeId": "127"
      },
      "127": {
        "id": "127",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "咕噜咕噜咕噜────！！！"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊……！动了的话会很糟哦",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "出界的话，那里也得涂黑，会变成超──大的兔子呢！",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊哈哈！请别动──消不掉的……啊哈哈哈！",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好、好的……那，我就不动，你尽管画个好的。",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不管是吃的还是我，都带着紧张感，画个好的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那是当然的吧……咕噜咕噜咕噜──……！！！！！"
      }
    }
  },
